      "en": "“‘“The men of Dedan traded with you. Many islands were the market of your hand. They brought you horns of ivory and ebony in exchange.",
      "ko": "드단 사람은 네 장사가 되었음이여 여러 섬이 너와 통상하여 상아와 오목을 가져 네 물품을 무역하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "11fac2f8cdddfe17b742b5a083b71889efc9204ffd9db303d84f6385f8883a87",
      "translation_text_hash": "2668092c4e16dbc7d889fd15869068ac69e1a3764386bcc9126322b0f002b92d",
