      "en": "“‘“Vedan and Javan traded with yarn for your wares; wrought iron, cassia, and calamus were among your merchandise.",
      "ko": "워단과 야완은 길쌈하는 실로 네 물품을 무역하였음이여 백철과 육계와 창포가 네 상품 중에 있었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "456fb53964500191cded31c44e301cc2136c3ca8fbb07266f311f872f6a44b60",
      "translation_text_hash": "b7e54bf3afb7ab1cc2105af6979dd16bb11d2aaec3e7bb6430cf65542566abe0",
