      "en": "At the sound of the cry of your pilots, the pasture lands will shake.",
      "ko": "네 선장의 부르짖는 소리에 물결이 흔들리리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "ee0b3d56a1b4e75c1492e0f6b0fa0536f056e660122bbbea56bfe01930b83d0c",
      "translation_text_hash": "ebd9ec15511fca3b1e46d30430a045edd0123ce16d1e66d37f8c396971c7c419",
